# --- esbuild output: api/<name>.js compiled from the tracked api/<name>.ts ---
# 13.1 MB across 81 files, all from one build (2026-08-03). They are generated,
# never committed, and were churning git status for three weeks. Listed explicitly
# rather than as api/*.js because 53 api/*.js files ARE hand-written source with no
# .ts sibling. Rule to regenerate: ignore api/X.js only where api/X.ts exists.
